# Bro.exe voice asset manifest.
#
# One entry per line:  kind|dest|url|member
#   kind    = file | tar | tardir
#   dest    = path under the staged voice asset root (e.g. app/src/main/assets/voice)
#   url     = download URL
#   member  = member path inside the archive (tar: one file, tardir: a subtree),
#             empty for file
#
# Hashes/sizes are recorded in scripts/voice_assets.lock (generated on CI, committed).

